    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><i>Atmospheric first-person exploration and petrol fueled third-person mechanical combat.</i></strong>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your character in first person to explore 1980s Tokyo, and to hand place and build each component on your robot-battler. Enter third-person view to control your battler in tournaments and other battle scenarios.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning fights earns you cash to spend on bigger, better parts, with variety to suit different play styles. Upgrades and alternate uses make experimenting endless.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SIMULATED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Components are individually simulated and all physics based, creating a chaotic and unpredictable world. Learn how they all work together to master your loadout.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES\u00a0(local + Steam remote play)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play campaign as single player or co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-4 local split screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free for all and team based</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the greatest robot-battler pilot that's ever lived, and now a corporation is trying to replace you with its automated pilots. Sounds like you're gonna have to step in with the.... MANUAL OVERRIDE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><i>Atmospheric first-person exploration and petrol fueled third-person mechanical combat.</i></strong>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your character in first person to explore 1980s Tokyo, and to hand place and build each component on your robot-battler. Enter third-person view to control your battler in tournaments and other battle scenarios.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning fights earns you cash to spend on bigger, better parts, with variety to suit different play styles. Upgrades and alternate uses make experimenting endless.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SIMULATED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Components are individually simulated and all physics based, creating a chaotic and unpredictable world. Learn how they all work together to master your loadout.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES\u00a0(local + Steam remote play)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play campaign as single player or co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-4 local split screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free for all and team based</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the greatest robot-battler pilot that's ever lived, and now a corporation is trying to replace you with its automated pilots. Sounds like you're gonna have to step in with the.... MANUAL OVERRIDE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
